{
  "id": "1SA.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sam 16",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etuputoki Daudi metaa olaiguanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Samuel, “Nchiraki akenya Saul o anu, idolita ajo atanya nanu ninye pee meaku olaiguanani te Israel? Imputa ina mouo eilata nilo; kaairriwaa nanu iyie enetii Yese, ilo Betlehemi, amu aing'uraka nanu kewan ai olaiguanani ti atua ilayiok lenyena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Samuel, “Kaji nanu aiko te nalo? Te nening Saul ina naar nanu matua.” Nejo Olaitoriani, “Iwa enkashe te nebo iyie nijo, ‘Aewuo pee apolosaki Olaitoriani olasar.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintoomon Yese meeu olasar, naa kaaitadol eniaas; nibukoki iyie eilata aput ilo laaipotoki enkarna enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas Samuel ina naitanapa Olaitoriani, nelotu Betlehem. Nepuonu ilpayiani le nkanasa eikirikira aanang'are ninye nejo, “Ilotu iyie te seriani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Te seriani; aewuo nanu apolosaki Olaitoriani; entisinya ate, nipuonunu te nebo nanu olasar.” Neitisiny ninye Yese o layiok lenyena, neitoomon ninche to lasar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ebau ninche, neing'or ninye Eliab, nedamu ajo, “Esipa etii ilo otubukoko Olaitoriani eilata aput dukuya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaaka Olaitoriani Samuel, “Ming'or enaikununo ninye arashu enkadoro enye o lkitashei lenye, amu atanya nanu ninye; amu meing'or Olaitoriani anaa enaing'or tung'ani; eing'or tung'ani enaikununo oriong, kake oltau eing'or Olaitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yese aipot Abinadab, neisho ninye metogiroi te dukuya Samuel. Nejo ninye, “Eitu sii egelu Olaitoriani ele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yese aisho Shamas metogiroi. Nejo ninye, “Eitu sii egelu Olaitoriani ele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho Yese ilayiok lenyena pokira oopishana metogiroi te dukuya Samuel. Nejoki Samuel Yese, “Eitu egelu Olaitoriani kulo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Samuel Yese, “Ketii ilayiok linono pooki ene?” Nejo ninye, “Etiooyo ilo oti, kake ng'ura, etii ntare.” Nejoki Samuel Yese, “Irriwai olkilikuai metorikuni ninye; amu mikitoni iyiook o metaba anaa nelotu ninye ene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa ninye olkilikuai, nerikuni ninye aaitijing'u. Naa kenyokie apa ninye newang nkonyek enyena, neikishiaan. Nejo Olaitoriani, “Tudumunye, tubukoki ninye eilata; amu ninye ele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya Samuel emowuo e ilata nebukoki ninye eilata aput te mpolos oo lalashera lenyena; nelotu Enkiyang'et o Laitoriani te ngolon shumata Daudi ebaiki ina olong neito dukuya. Nedumunye Samuel nelo Rama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi te nkaji e nkitoo e Saul",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Enkiyang'et e Nkai aing'uaa Saul, nelotu enkiyang'et torrono naing'uaa Olaitoriani aitanyamal aisomit ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Saul isinkan lenyena, “Ng'ura taata, kintanyamalita iyie enkiyang'et torrono naing'uaa Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo taata olkitok lang eitanap isinkan linono ootii dukuya iyie, pee eing'oru oltung'ani oyiolo atoosho enkawuo oo sinkolioitin; ore ake pee eitoki atii shumata iyie enkiyang'et torrono naing'uaa Enkai, nerany ninye te ina auo oo sinkolioitin, naa inchiu iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etiaaka Saul isinkan lenyena, “Entorikokoki nanu oltung'ani oyiolo ataranya oleng, nirikuku ninye ene natii.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal obo loo lbarnot ajo, “Ng'ura, atoduaa nanu olayioni le Yese le Betlehem, laa kaarriyia te ranyare, oltung'ani opi, naa oltung'ani lo larrabal, arriyia te nkiroroto naa oltung'ani le nkishaa sidai; netii Olaitoriani te nebo ninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eirriwayie Saul ilkiliku enetii Yese nejo, “Irriwakaki nanu Daudi, olayioni lino, laa ninye otii ntare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayu Yese olkurrarruu onap imukateni, olbene lo lchoni le naisho, o lkuoo le kine, neirriwaa ninche te Daudi, olayioni lenye, airriwaki Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Daudi enetii Saul, nejing enkisiaayiare enye. Nenyorru Saul ninye oleng; neaku ninye olanapani lenye loo masaa o larrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaki Saul olkilikuai Yese, ejo, “Nchoo Daudi eton te nkisiaayiare ai, amu enoto ninye omom too nkonyek aainei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore ake pee elotu enkiyang'et torrono naing'uaa Enkai shumata Saul, nedumu Daudi enkawuo oo sinkolioitin neosh te nkaina enye; neaku eitagoloki apa Saul, nesupatu, neing'uaa ninye ina kiyang'et torrono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
